    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the twilight of the solar system, some beats never die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ageless beings cling to relics of a distant past, chasing shadows of shelter from the ever-creeping Red Dwarf our Sun has become. Among the cosmos, one substance still sets the universe on fire\u2014<strong>Mercury</strong>. Mysterious. Musical. Magnetic. Forged only on the last terraforming stations, it fuels immortality for some and endless energy for others. And its power? Transmuted by sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fi</strong>\u2014a symphony of survival and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your vessel as it gallops above a garden orbiting Mars. Build your base\u2014make it a sonic sanctuary or an unbreakable fortress. Grow, gather, or groove at your own pace. Then plug in and <strong>amplify</strong>\u2014use MIDI inputs to bend the world with your music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your stage is set, dive headfirst into the secrets of the Precursors. Scavenge rare plants and treasure to upgrade your <strong>Drum and Bass</strong>. Or switch gears\u2014toss your drummer in the backseat and <strong>shred across space with Rock and Roll</strong>. Whether you're a solo act or leading a Capitol Ship packed with your crew, you'll be <strong>blasting away while blasting away</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fi</strong> blends cozy base-building with a beat-driven multiplayer twist. A relaxing jam session with friends\u2014or a full-throttle concert of chaos. With percussion and concussions, it's rhythm meets rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Novice to Rockstar, <strong>Fi</strong> drums up a way for everyone to play\u2014even the most unlikely of bandmates.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the twilight of the solar system, some beats never die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ageless beings cling to relics of a distant past, chasing shadows of shelter from the ever-creeping Red Dwarf our Sun has become. Among the cosmos, one substance still sets the universe on fire\u2014<strong>Mercury</strong>. Mysterious. Musical. Magnetic. Forged only on the last terraforming stations, it fuels immortality for some and endless energy for others. And its power? Transmuted by sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fi</strong>\u2014a symphony of survival and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your vessel as it gallops above a garden orbiting Mars. Build your base\u2014make it a sonic sanctuary or an unbreakable fortress. Grow, gather, or groove at your own pace. Then plug in and <strong>amplify</strong>\u2014use MIDI inputs to bend the world with your music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your stage is set, dive headfirst into the secrets of the Precursors. Scavenge rare plants and treasure to upgrade your <strong>Drum and Bass</strong>. Or switch gears\u2014toss your drummer in the backseat and <strong>shred across space with Rock and Roll</strong>. Whether you're a solo act or leading a Capitol Ship packed with your crew, you'll be <strong>blasting away while blasting away</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fi</strong> blends cozy base-building with a beat-driven multiplayer twist. A relaxing jam session with friends\u2014or a full-throttle concert of chaos. With percussion and concussions, it's rhythm meets rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Novice to Rockstar, <strong>Fi</strong> drums up a way for everyone to play\u2014even the most unlikely of bandmates.</p>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019re not just pulling the trigger\u2014you\u2019re syncing to the rhythm. Pilot high-powered battle ships across fractured terraforming platforms and unleash synchronized destruction in this pulse-pounding fusion of First-Person Shooting, reactive MIDI Combat and Cozy Gardening from your Deployed Base\u0336s",
